{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05454","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 徐知仁","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣德膺三统，皇恩被八埏。\n大明均照物，小丑未宁边。\n国相台衡重，元戎庙略宣。\n紫泥方受命，黄石乃推贤。\n问辠阴山下，安人属国前。\n度关行照月，乘障坐消烟。\n北阙纡宸藻，南桥列祖筵。\n耀威当夏日，杀气指秋天。\n鞞鼓鼋鼍振，旌旗鸟兽悬。\n由来词翰手，今见勒燕然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐知仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}